    "text": "As shown in the following figures, block of mass <math><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></math> is in equilibrium in the vertical plane.<br />\r<br />\r<br />\r<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/ci/image51-e9ed86d4-3d80-427f-9915-375527cd65f9.jpg\" /><br />\r<br />\rAt a certain instant right spring in case-<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn></math> and right string in case-<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn></math> are cut. Then the ratio of instantaneous acceleration of block in case-<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn></math> to case-<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn></math> just after the cutting is (strings and springs are ideal)",
